    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "David Ross Estate Agents, your local property experts, are proud to present new to the market for sale no.430 Mourne Road. This fine 3 bedroom semi detached property in the heart of Drimnagh comes to the market, sure to catch the eye of any discerning purchaser.\r\n\r\nNumber 430 is surrounded by a host of local amenities with plenty of shops and restaurants nearby as well as fantastic sports facilities and parks. This area is also within very close proximity to Rialto and Crumlin.\r\n\r\nWalking through the front door you are met with a warm entrance hallway. Just off this you enter a cosy and spacious living room fitted with a classic fireplace. Moving through the property you have a fully fitted kitchen alongside a toilet and bathroom. \r\n\r\nTo the rear of the property you have a private back garden with a convenient side entrance, a great space to relax or entertain family and friends.\r\n\r\nUpstairs briefly comprises three bedrooms, a double alongside a single to the rear and a main double bedroom to the front aspect. A family bathroom completes the first floor.\r\n\r\nThis area benefits from great public transport links with several bus routes running through the area. The M50 motorway is also only a short drive away which opens up access to the Greater Dublin Area and surrounding counties. \r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Semi detached\r\n- Side entrance\r\n- Prime location\r\n- Public transport links"
      },
      {
